## What We Are Building

Closing the gap between «the pipeline runs» and «Полина (EXEC-CONC) can actually drive it». The Director kept hitting operator failures in real time: Полина announces intent and stalls, can't resolve human references (filenames/«latest»), is pinned to the wrong episode, and the gate chain skips Casting. Each was root-caused in code and fixed subtractively, shipped to master, and verified (tsc / 951 vitest / 30 replay-pilot). The arc also pinned strategic decisions (model routing, casting order, goal-loop sequencing) for later phases.

