- **SH-numbering verifier** `collectShotIdViolations` (`webapp/lib/agents/runners/storyboarder.ts`) — confirmed: 6 unit tests green; tsc·0. Commit `7094c8d`, merged to master, **pushed to origin** (`ffdd212..842560f`).
- **Goal-loop slice 1** — auto-react = real agent loop. `webapp/lib/concierge/auto-react-loop.ts` (backstop 25 + spin/dup guard), wired into chat-internal (re-wake/escalate) + chat. 10 unit tests green; tsc·0. Commit `842560f`, merged + **pushed**.
- **Bible TOC** `headingToc` (`webapp/lib/concierge/doc-toc.ts`) + listSeriesBibles returns per-asset `toc` + prompt points «темы → general_idea Seed Bank». 6 unit tests green. Commit `028b461`, merged to master (**NOT pushed**).
- **Chat follows OPEN episode** — `ConciergePanel` sends `usePathname` episodeId; chat route adopts it + re-binds thread (`updateThreadEpisode`); STUDIO_STATE shows episode CODE + «resolve, don't stall» directive. tsc·0, 948 green. Commit `05f13c7`, merged (**NOT pushed**). Preview reloaded clean on E12.
- **Casting gate Brief→Casting→Writer** (Director modes) — `next-events.ts` (brief→writer only in AUTOTEST; SPC-episode_cast APPROVED → writer), `pipeline-stages.ts` reorder, castEpisode description. +3 gate tests, pipeline-order test updated. **tsc·0 · vitest 951/951 · replay-pilot 30/30**. Commit `bc86341`, merged (**NOT pushed**).
- **object_smartphone consistency** — confirmed slug `object_smartphone` matches across canon / script v04 / storyboard. The Director LOCKED it himself in the UI (verified DRAFT→LOCKED in DB at 09:17). bible-loader loads only LOCKED → it's now real canon.

